  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f5NVNkNB\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/353935/description_d769ec2a-89ab-4c7d-bb1b-04123f4c4c53.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"372\"></span></a></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">Project MMO 是一款讓你在遊戲過程中獲得相關技能經驗值的模組。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">獲得的經驗值可以提升特定技能等級，解鎖新物品並獲得特殊能力。部分能力包括：<br></span></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">移動速度提升</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">跳躍高度增加</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">挖掘/採礦加速</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">水下呼吸時間延長</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害輸出提高</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以及其他更多能力</span></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PMMO 還具有根據解鎖物品或技能等級調整的特殊功能，例如：</span></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">礦脈連鎖採集</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">額外掉落（類似技能型幸運效果）</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">寶藏掉落（稀有戰利品）</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">根據玩家強度調整的怪物難度</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">與朋友組隊共享經驗值並獲得加成</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">物品拆解還原為材料</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">還有更多功能！</span></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></span><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Project_MMO/BH_PMMO_PlayWithFriends.png\" width=\"760\" height=\"167\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:18px\">想要擁有自己的 Minecraft 伺服器卻不想費心設置和託管？直接租用現成的吧！<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Project_MMO/BH_PMMO_PromoCard.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"761\" height=\"167\"></a><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">點擊上方圖片 -> 選擇方案 -> 使用我的優惠碼「Harmonised」</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">即可獲得首月 </span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">25% 折扣 -> </span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">與朋友盡情暢玩！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://harmonised7.github.io/minecraft/pmmo/Features.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:none !important\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Project_MMO/BH_PMMO_Youtube.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"760\" height=\"167\"><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5lcZ853-jkA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"849\" height=\"849\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></a></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:18px\">特別感謝影片製作者 BoodlyNeck 的精彩呈現！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:18px\">(Project MMO 介紹從 3:14 開始)</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Project_MMO/BH_PMMO_Community.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"760\" height=\"167\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5NVNkNB\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/A_Bit_of_Everything/BH_BOE_Discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"211\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/vanilla-mmo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/A_Bit_of_Everything/BH_BOE_ServerCardLink.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"230\" height=\"75\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/harmonised\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/82/Patreon_logo_with_wordmark.svg/1024px-Patreon_logo_with_wordmark.svg.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"229\" height=\"53\"></a></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fharmonised\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/5cbec633ae2b882fff068659_ko-fi_horizontal-p-800.png\" alt=\"ko-fi\" width=\"72\" height=\"29\"></a></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f687007281539579927%252f1117257118760837160\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Project_MMO/BH_PMMO_Information.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"756\" height=\"166\"></a><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5NVNkNB\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/A_Bit_of_Everything/BH_BOE_Discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"211\" height=\"69\"></a></span></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:18px\"><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Project_MMO/BH_PMMO_Technical.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"756\" height=\"166\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>支援模組：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">支援 Craft Tweaker API（請參閱原始碼 README.txt）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">100% 支援 Curios Items</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">99.9% 的模組與 PMMO 相容</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pmmo-and-nbt-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">PMMO 與 NBT 相容 - 支援 NBT Json 設定</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pmmo-bridge\" rel=\"nofollow\">PMMO Bridge - 為多個模組添加 PMMO 支援的相容性模組！</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-mmo-and-cooking-for-blockheads-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">由 ToxicMintTea 製作的 Cooking for Blockheads 相容性模組！</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixinbootstrap\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.15 版本需要 mixin 來實現部分功能！（非主要功能）</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastfurnace-minus-replacement\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fast Furnace 模組會破壞 PMMO 的熔煉和烹飪功能，<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastfurnace-minus-replacement\" rel=\"nofollow\">甚至可能導致遊戲崩潰。點我獲取可相容的 Fast Furnace 版本！</a></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastfurnace-minus-replacement\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Project_MMO/BH_PMMO_Break.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"54\"></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fprojectmmo.oneskyapp.com%252fcollaboration%252fproject%252f174961\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>想新增自己的語言？點這裡！</strong></a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>想讓你的模組與本模組整合？<a href=\"https://discord.gg/5NVNkNB\" rel=\"nofollow\">透過 Discord 聯絡我！</a></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">部分數值可自動生成，</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">其他則需由玩家/模組包製作者/我手動設定。</span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Project_MMO/BH_PMMO_Break.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"54\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br>歡迎在模組包中使用本模組，只要附上本頁連結，<br>且模組包無需付費即可遊玩！</span><br></span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Project_MMO/BH_PMMO_Break.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"54\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f5NVNkNB\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Project_MMO/BH_PMMO_Header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"759\" height=\"305\"></span></a></span></span></p>",
